systerm (0.2.11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Atlas: never leave a blank, buttonless card. The streaming worker died on any
    non-JSON line (json.loads raised outside the caught exceptions), so a card
    could sit empty with no answer, no error, and no recovery buttons. Skip
    malformed lines, add a catch-all so any failure becomes a visible message, and
    when the stream completes with zero output show a clear "no output — is the
    server up / is <model> pulled?" message with the recovery buttons. Clearer
    unreachable-server text (includes the URL + the underlying error).

