systerm (0.1.8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Act as a proper x-terminal-emulator: honor -e/-x/--command (run a command
    instead of a login shell) and --working-directory. This makes "Open
    Terminal" / "Open in SysTerm" from file managers and the desktop work,
    since those invoke the terminal as `systerm -e ...`.
  * Open in the caller's directory: the first pane now starts in the process
    working directory (so "Open here" lands in that folder) instead of always
    $HOME.
  * Packaging: declare gir1.2-pango-1.0 (imported directly) so the .deb is
    self-contained.

